"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunkmhm_slotiva_docs=globalThis.webpackChunkmhm_slotiva_docs||[]).push([[195],{4320(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"slotiva-1-0-3","metadata":{"permalink":"/mhm-slotiva-docs/tr/release-notes/slotiva-1-0-3","editUrl":"https://github.com/MaxHandMade/mhm-slotiva-docs/tree/main/blog/2026-11-16-slotiva-1-0-3.md","source":"@site/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-11-16-slotiva-1-0-3.md","title":"Slotiva 1.0.3","description":"Kurulum sihirbaz\u0131n\u0131 yeniden \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmak \xfcr\xfcn\xfcn kendi ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 korur, s\u0131n\u0131rlar netle\u015fti ve bu siteye yard\u0131m ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 geldi.","date":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[],"frontMatter":{"slug":"slotiva-1-0-3","title":"Slotiva 1.0.3","description":"Kurulum sihirbaz\u0131n\u0131 yeniden \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmak \xfcr\xfcn\xfcn kendi ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 korur, s\u0131n\u0131rlar netle\u015fti ve bu siteye yard\u0131m ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 geldi."},"unlisted":false},"content":"Slotiva 1.0.3 bir bak\u0131m s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc. Randevulu bir \xfcr\xfcn\xfc zaten kurduysan en \xf6nemli de\u011fi\u015fiklik \u015fu: kurulum sihirbaz\u0131n\u0131 yeniden\\n\xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmak art\u0131k o \xfcr\xfcn\xfcn kendi ayarlar\u0131na dokunmuyor.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## D\xfczeltilenler\\n\\n- **Kurulum sihirbaz\u0131n\u0131 yeniden \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmak \xfcr\xfcn\xfcn ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 korur.** Mevcut randevulu \xfcr\xfcn kendi randevu s\xfcresini, sipari\u015fteki\\n  en az saat say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve fiyatlamas\u0131n\u0131 korur. 3. ad\u0131m \xfcr\xfcn\xfcn kendi s\xfcresini korudu\u011funu s\xf6yler; m\xfc\u015fteri \xf6nizlemesi ve \xf6zet o s\xfcreyi\\n  g\xf6sterir. Bkz. [Kurulum sihirbaz\u0131](/docs/getting-started/setup-wizard#step-3).\\n- **\xd6zet hizmet t\xfcr\xfcn\xfc her zaman g\xf6sterir**, \xf6nerilen t\xfcr\xfc bir karta t\u0131klamadan b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011f\u0131nda da.\\n- **Randevu s\xfcresi i\xe7in tek s\u0131n\u0131r: 480 dakika (8 saat).** S\xfcre girebildi\u011fin her yerde ge\xe7erli \u2014 kurulum sihirbaz\u0131, Slotiva \u2192\\n  \xc7al\u0131\u015fma saatleri ve \xfcr\xfcn\xfcn Slotiva sekmesi. Daha \xf6nce daha uzun bir s\xfcre kaydedildiyse bu, di\u011fer \xe7al\u0131\u015fma saati ayarlar\u0131n\u0131\\n  kaydetmeni engellemez. Sihirbaz ge\xe7erli bir say\u0131 olmayan fiyat\u0131 da kabul etmez.\\n- Slotiva\'y\u0131 kurulum sihirbaz\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7amayacak bir yolla etkinle\u015ftirmek (\xf6rne\u011fin komut sat\u0131r\u0131ndan ya da a\u011f genelinde) art\u0131k seni\\n  sonra sihirbaza g\xf6nderecek eski bir \\"sihirbaz\u0131 a\xe7\\" notunu geride b\u0131rakm\u0131yor.\\n\\n## De\u011fi\u015fenler\\n\\n- **Lisans ekran\u0131:** g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcmler ve metinler ayn\u0131, art\u0131k anahtar girildikten sonra her durumun alt\u0131nda bir yard\u0131m ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 var. G\xfcncelleme ipucu\\n  WordPress\'in g\xfcncel men\xfcs\xfcn\xfc s\xf6yl\xfcyor: **Eklentiler \u2192 Eklenti ekle \u2192 Eklenti y\xfckle**.\\n- **Slotiva \u2192 Ayarlar \u2192 Randevulu \xfcr\xfcnler** fiyatlamay\u0131 \u0130ngilizcede de \xfcr\xfcn\xfcn Slotiva sekmesindeki s\xf6zc\xfckle g\xf6steriyor (**Per slot**); T\xfcrk\xe7ede ikisi zaten **Saat ba\u015f\u0131na**.\\n- **Kurulum sihirbaz\u0131ndaki \xf6deme kontrol\xfc** art\u0131k bir \xf6deme y\xf6ntemini nereden a\xe7aca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6yl\xfcyor: WooCommerce \u2192 Ayarlar \u2192 \xd6demeler.\\n- T\xfcrk\xe7e y\xf6netim metinleri art\u0131k her yerde ayn\u0131 samimi \\"sen\\" dilini kullan\u0131yor.\\n\\n## Eklenenler\\n\\n- **Bu belgelere yard\u0131m ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131:** kurulum sihirbaz\u0131n\u0131n sonunda **\u0130lk kurulum rehberi**, \xf6deme sayfas\u0131 kontrol\xfcnde ilgilenmen\\n  gereken her sat\u0131rda **Nas\u0131l d\xfczeltilir** ve Lisans ekran\u0131nda **Bu lisans durumu hakk\u0131nda**. WordPress\'i T\xfcrk\xe7e kullanan\\n  y\xf6neticiler T\xfcrk\xe7e sayfalara gider.\\n\\n## G\xfcncelleme\\n\\n1.0.3\'\xfc hesab\u0131ndan indir ve **Eklentiler \u2192 Eklenti ekle \u2192 Eklenti y\xfckle** ile kur \u2014 bkz.\\n[G\xfcncelleme](/docs/getting-started/installation#g\xfcncelleme). Randevular\u0131n, \xe7al\u0131\u015fma saatlerin ve ayarlar\u0131n korunur."}]}}')}}]);